WEBVTT

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.900
The world tournament for youth soccer, Football Frontier International,

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.840
otherwise known as FFI Vision 2 is ready to open,

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:22.410
and here at Holy Road Stadium, the members for New Inazuma Japan are about to be announced!

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.300
Tenma... this day has come at last.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:00.060
Inazuma Japan against the world, huh...

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.940
I wonder who's going to be picked.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.940
I can't wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:05.790
Tenma.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:10.250
You sound as if you're certain you'll be on the team.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.360
N-Not at all!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.800
This time, it's the world!

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.840
Hey! Keep your voices down.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.220
Oh, sorry...

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.000
Shindou-san.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.770
We've come far.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:26.340
Yeah.

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:29.270
<i>That's not soccer!</i>

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:31.840
<i>What would you know?!</i>

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:35.140
<i>What would you know about how we feel playing soccer?</i>

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:38.570
<i>About how Sangoku-san feels having to let those shoots go in?</i>

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.660
<i>Do you know how that feels?!</i>

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:50.730
The members of Inazuma Japan who will fight against the world are now to be announced!

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:01.350
I appreciate the time you have spent in choosing the members.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.260
Yes.

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:06.060
Nevertheless, what a surprise.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:10.020
For you to choose members such as them...

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:14.300
They were chosen exactly because the stakes are high.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.190
There will be no problem.

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:21.200
Show us what you can do, Coach.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.880
Now, time to introduce you!

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:44.640
This man, Coach Kuroiwa Ryuusei, will take up the position of Inazuma Japan's coach!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.980
I am Inazuma Japan's coach, Kuroiwa.

00:02:55.380 --> 00:03:01.180
You have been gathered at this field because you possess the power suitable for candidacy.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.480
However...

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:07.490
Out of this group, only eleven of you will be chosen as Japan's representatives.

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.660
Just eleven?

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.500
That's all?

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.960
I'm even more nervous now!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:22.930
I will now announce the members of New Inazuma Japan for FFI Vision 2.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:02.690
And now...

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:07.120
Inazuma Japan's captain!

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.080
Matsukaze Tenma!

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:12.200
Shindou Takuto!

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.960
Tsurugi Kyousuke!

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.630
Matatagi Hayato!

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:23.050
Nozaki Sakura!

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.550
Kusaka Ryuuji!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.550
Manabe Jin'ichirou!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.060
Tetsukado Shin!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.560
Morimura Konoha!

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.060
Minaho Kazuto!

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.560
Ibuki Munemasa!

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.480
Those are the eleven.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.640
T-Tenma...

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:47.940
I'm happy for you.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.080
Shinsuke...

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.830
Congratulations! Do your best!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.830
Shinsuke...

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.000
If your name was called, come up to the front.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.640
I've never even seen these members before.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:12.430
Yeah.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:17.730
Take a good look, everyone! They are the pride of our country, New Inazuma Japan!

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:21.100
I barely know most of them.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:22.270
Yeah...

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:27.600
A majority of these players don't appear to have any previous game data.

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.540
Yes...

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:32.570
What do you think of this, Matsui-san?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:38.020
Coach Kuroiwa, who is well known for his achievements overseas, has selected these players.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:42.540
They must be incredibly strong despite being unknown!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:48.220
All eleven of you have the duty of aiming for the world.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.080
Is that understood?

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:51.080
Yes, sir!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:54.560
Then show me your abilities.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.980
We will now hold an exhibition match!

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:00.580
Now?!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:02.960
Right off the bat...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.820
But this way, we'll be able to learn more about these members.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.280
The match will be held in 10 minutes.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:15.870
I'm representing Japan...

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.320
Why were they chosen?

00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:22.920
Yeah...

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.180
Tenma.

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.180
Yes?

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:32.880
We know nothing about their abilities or peculiarities.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:35.500
Will you be able to lead them well?

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:39.980
I'm sure there were incredible players hidden around that we just didn't know about.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.140
I can't wait to see what they can do!

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:44.940
Everyone, listen up.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.000
Good luck, Tenma!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.220
You can do it!

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.220
Go show them!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.000
Tenma!

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.200
Shinsuke...

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:07.130
I'll do my best, for everyone.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:15.460
The exhibition match to commemorate the birth of New Inazuma Japan will now take place!

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.470
The opponent for their debut match is...

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:23.980
The prestigious soccer school, Teikoku Academy!

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:27.160
Teikoku Academy...

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.400
Coach Kuroiwa.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:15.400
Show me the power of the Inazuma Japan that you have chosen.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.530
This looks to be turning out into an interesting development, Coach.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:27.420
Now, let me explain a new rule that has been established for FFI Vision 2!

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:34.080
Avatars and all other related conduct that have been frequently used up to now are no longer allowed!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:37.970
This new rule will be applied for this match!

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:42.890
What is being desired here are basic soccer techniques rather than the power emphasis that we have seen previously!

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:47.360
It will be interesting to see how this new rule will affect their plays.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:53.920
Avatars, Avatar Armed, and even Miximax are prohibited.

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:56.610
That's fine in its own way, isn't it?

00:09:57.060 --> 00:10:02.120
By limiting the players' abilities, they discover new possibilities.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.240
This is the rule that you proposed.

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:10.130
You will make known to everyone here your abilities.

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:11.500
Yes, sir!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:16.480
Teikoku Academy only accepts victory.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:17.470
Is that understood?

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:18.970
Yes, sir!

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:25.390
The match between New Inazuma Japan and Teikoku Academy will begin momentarily!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:33.400
From this match, we will see the abilities of those who bear Japan's honor!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.110
There's the kickoff!

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:40.110
Shindou-san!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:41.900
Hey, representatives!

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.410
Show me what you guys can do!

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:46.530
You're not getting through!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:47.950
Tsurugi!

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:54.360
All right, go!

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.170
Aggressive-

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.510
Sargasso V2!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:04.600
Not yet!

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.310
Shindou-san!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:09.730
Okay, time to try it out.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.520
Listen up.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:16.690
We've only met today, but in order to win, we have to work together.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.780
All of you, cooperate with me.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.160
Everyone, I'm counting on you.

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:27.020
God's Baton: Fire Illusion!

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.600
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:37.660
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.680
God's Baton: Fire Illusion!

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.510
Go, Matatagi!

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:49.810
What?

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:52.600
Shindou-san!

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:54.520
Nozaki!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.220
Kusaka!

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.400
Those guys...

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.980
Why aren't they going where I direct them?

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:07.450
Shindou-san, let's take this one step at a time!

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.040
Okay.

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:12.120
Everyone, we'll bring it up one by one!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:19.180
I've had a look at their player data.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:22.800
What's wrong, Inazuma Japan?!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.220
They're hardly putting up a fight!

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:25.430
Tetsukado!

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:26.940
Okay!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:30.100
What?

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:32.980
Tch.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.940
When it flies towards me like that, it looks like a punch.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:37.860
Tetsukado Shin.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.980
He holds the world title in boxing...

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:45.240
...but has zero experience with soccer.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.120
He's fast!

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:51.740
Matatagi Hayato, from the track club.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:55.080
He can run so fast that he's known as the Speed Star.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.800
What?

00:12:58.980 --> 00:12:59.540
How's that?

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.410
Just being fast isn't enough!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:03.420
Huh?

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.620
Oh, I see, I have to take the ball.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.740
He is also a beginner at soccer.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:17.810
Are you okay?

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.980
Morimura Konoha.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.560
No experience whatsoever in an athletics club.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.320
I've never played soccer before...

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.960
Kusaka Ryuuji.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:36.790
He's quite the troublemaker.

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:44.360
Hey now, friend, that was close to a foul there.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.740
That wasn't very nice.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:48.960
Dummy, that's because you're slow.

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:51.540
What? That was my fault just now?

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.540
That can't be right.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:56.720
You're weak for falling over from a little thing like that.

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:59.000
Move.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:04.030
A hardcore delinquent who controls five school gangs.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.990
What the f@%$?!

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:11.160
Did you just call me weak?!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.660
Did you?!

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.170
You guys okay?

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.360
Sorry about that, fellas.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.520
I just can't help it when the blood rushes to my head.

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.760
W-What is wrong with this guy?

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.380
Manabe Jin'ichirou.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:37.480
He also has no experience in athletics.

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:40.230
But he does have a rather interesting history.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:44.760
He's the champion of Japan's superhuman computation contest.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:51.200
When approached from 20 degrees, the position and angle of stopping them is 2A+3-α...

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:53.500
I see it!

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:57.080
Huh? My calculation...

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:04.460
Nozaki Sakura.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:06.460
An ace at rhythmic gymnastics.

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:11.520
Huh? That was a level E difficulty just now. No good?

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:13.510
This is soccer!

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.560
Will you manage to get through me?

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.580
Minaho Kazuto.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:23.040
His father is a brilliant detective whose expertise awarded him recognition from the Police Commissioner.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.060
As I expected.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:28.230
From the dirt on your shoes, I can see which is your dominant foot.

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:35.080
And from the way you unconsciously look in the direction of where you want to go, I have anticipated your route!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:37.700
You're not taking another step past me! Too bad for you!

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:42.480
What?! Why?!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.250
Now this is very interesting...

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.090
Quit playing around!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.050
Emperor Penguin 7!

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:07.440
He blocked it!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.700
He blocked Teikoku's hissatsu shoot!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.410
He's pretty good, that goalkeeper!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.900
Finally, someone who knows what he's doing.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:17.120
Ibuki Munemasa.

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:23.180
He is a world-class basketball player.

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.830
C'mon, try and steal it from me.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:27.090
What?

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:33.510
You're kidding!

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:47.020
Things are getting out of hand!

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:51.860
I don't believe this! Teikoku Academy has a 3-point lead on Inazuma Japan!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:53.940
Why?

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.920
Why are those guys Japan's representatives?!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:59.330
With them, the world will see Japan's soccer as nothing but a joke!

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:09.290
What will you do, Coach?

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:15.080
Will Inazuma Japan be able to recover?!

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.560
What...

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.940
Just what the hell is this?!

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:39.720
This...

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:41.800
This is Inazuma Japan?!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:44.290
Shindou-san, I'll draw the other team to me midfield, so...

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:47.830
With members like these, we won't win no matter what we do!

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:49.830
It's over!

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:51.340
Damn it!

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.550
Not yet.

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.020
What?

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:57.760
It's not over yet.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.100
I won't give up!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.930
As long as we don't give up, it's not over!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:06.890
Tenma...

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:11.060
I'm sorry, for talking out of line.

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.820
No...

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.160
In that case, we'll win points between just the three of us!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.410
Okay!

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:27.710
Windhole Drive!

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.460
We won't give up!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:44.510
God's Baton: Fire Illusion!

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:51.770
Fire Tornado Double Drive!

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:55.460
Power Spike V3!

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.580
Goal!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:06.120
Inazuma Japan takes back a point!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:10.960
The goal is scored by Matsukaze, Tsurugi, and Shindou... Raimon's combination!

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:17.000
The match ends!

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:19.020
What a shocking outcome!

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:23.840
This is perhaps the worst beginning to be made for New Inazuma Japan!

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:26.460
No way...

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.900
We lost...

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.340
Matsui-san, what do you think of this?

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.070
This is very unprecedented.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.740
It's highly possible for there to be a change in coaches.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.180
What a shame, what a real shame.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.840
Is this team really what the coach wants?

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.860
Why...

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:49.900
Why were they chosen for Inazuma Japan?

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:54.460
We trained so hard for this day...

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:58.880
Thank you.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.220
Thank you.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.510
I'm sorely disappointed.

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.770
Damn it!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.140
Shindou-san...

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:26.640
What are you going to do about this?!

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:30.240
At this rate, Inazuma Japan's reputation is in ruins!

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:32.680
Why on earth would you choose those members...?

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.540
I have no need to explain myself to you.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.560
I am the coach.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:41.170
Coach Kuroiwa...

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:44.580
They're the worst...

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:47.320
They're the worst Inazuma Japan in history!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:53.180
What are you thinking, Coach Kuroiwa?

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:55.000
No...

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:57.320
My mentor, Kageyama Reiji...

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.660
What is this...

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:11.080
Endou, is it?

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:13.280
Everything is going according to plan here.

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.020
How is the matter I asked of you turning out?

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:19.320
I see.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:20.040
Very well.

00:22:53.900 --> 00:22:56.890
To level up for the Asia preliminaries, we hold a training camp!

00:22:56.890 --> 00:23:00.190
Will we really manage to win with these mysterious members?

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:03.860
Next, Foreboding Dark Clouds! The World Tournament Opens!!

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:06.030
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:19.380
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:25.400
As long as we don't give up, it's not over!

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:26.420
That's all!
